## TOR config for IP rotation
## SOCKS5 proxy on port 9050 (for Playwright)
## Control port on 9051 (for newnym signal)

SOCKSPort 0.0.0.0:9050
ControlPort 9051
CookieAuthentication 0
DataDirectory /tmp/tor_data
Log notice stdout

## Don't be a relay
ORPort 0
ExitRelay 0
BridgeRelay 0

## Performance tuning — sticky exit IP per session
## A signup takes ~1-2 min; a circuit that rotates mid-session (old 60s)
## changes the exit IP mid-registration, which Discord flags. Keep one
## circuit for the whole session; the bot signals NEWNYM between attempts
## to force a fresh exit node per account.
NumCPUs 1
MaxCircuitDirtiness 900 seconds
NewCircuitPeriod 60 seconds
